WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.256
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind interpreting data.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:10.383
Count: tells how many items are present. Sum: adds numbers together.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.621
Average: shares a total evenly across the number of values. Maximum: is the largest

00:00:16.621 --> 00:00:18.944
value. Minimum: is the smallest value.

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:24.562
Collect a few harmless facts about classroom materials, NOT personal details. Make a

00:00:24.562 --> 00:00:29.341
paper chart with the terms Count, Sum and Average; explain what each means.
